    {
      "id": "end_home",
      "text": "You stay in Kansas. You marry, eventually. Your children grow up listening to a story their teachers don't quite believe. The shoes, you keep in a drawer.",
      "sceneTitle": "There's No Place Like Home",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "There's No Place Like Home"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_oz",
      "text": "Years later you find a way back. You become, eventually, the steward of Emerald City. The scarecrow and tin man are, by then, regents. The lion is, mostly, a sleepy mayor.",
      "sceneTitle": "Back to Oz",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Back to Oz"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_storyteller",
      "text": "You write the book down. The book becomes a movie. The movie becomes part of every Sunday afternoon for decades. You die quietly. Toto is, by then, a small grand-pup.",
